        {
          "text": " Eki n'ekigambo ekyaizire ahari Yeremia nikiruga ahari MUKAMA, obu omugabe Zedekia yaamutumaho Pashuri mwene Malikia, na Zefania omunyamurwa mwene Maaseya, ",
