        {
          "text": " naagira ati: Tubuurize MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni aizire kuturwanisa; obundi MUKAMA akaatugirira nk'eby'okutangaaza ebi akora oku biri, amutwihaho, areka kututeera.",
